OL,3,GNEWSAOutlander star criticises data
OL,4,Acentre plan for nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutlander star Sam Heughan has joined
OL,7,Fthe campaign against plans to build a
OL,8,Fgiant data centre at a former nuclear
OL,9,Fsite in the south of Scotland.
OL,11,FThe actor - who grew up in Galloway -
OL,12,Fquestioned how much financial benefit
OL,13,Fprojects like the one at Chapelcross,
OL,14,Fnear Annan, would deliver to Scotland.
OL,16,FHe said the actual number of jobs
OL,17,Fdelivered after the construction phase
OL,18,Fhad been completed would be "very few".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
