OL,3,GNEWSAOutlander star criticises data
OL,4,Acentre plan for nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FCX Tech Ltd, which is behind the plans,
OL,7,Fsaid it could deliver more than 500
OL,8,Ffull-time posts and represented a
OL,9,F"once-in-a-generation opportunity" for
OL,10,Fthe region.
